    "detailed_description": "Are you ready to become a full-size boxer? With Arvis Punch you can face different enemies to become one, train like a professional boxer in the virtual gym and practice with the interactive and challenging elements. All in Arvis Punch!.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will start out in our gym, where you can warm up with our intractables and minigames!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWarm enough? Then head to the main stage and START THE FIGHT!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your own fists, and Punch your enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Arvis Punch, you can train as you would expect in a real gym with our physics-based punching bags, and dummy, as well as to simulate a fight with our AI controlled boxers!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFace your opponent during several rounds, and get to knock them out before they knock you!",
    "about_the_game": "Are you ready to become a full-size boxer? With Arvis Punch you can face different enemies to become one, train like a professional boxer in the virtual gym and practice with the interactive and challenging elements. All in Arvis Punch!.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will start out in our gym, where you can warm up with our intractables and minigames!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWarm enough? Then head to the main stage and START THE FIGHT!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your own fists, and Punch your enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Arvis Punch, you can train as you would expect in a real gym with our physics-based punching bags, and dummy, as well as to simulate a fight with our AI controlled boxers!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFace your opponent during several rounds, and get to knock them out before they knock you!",
    "short_description": "Become the best boxer by training and fighting with all the boxers and immersive elements. Test your senses and enjoy real boxing simulation at your fingertips.",
